{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TerrApocalipse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Defend planet Terra from threats, meet your unimaginably powerful enemy, build  spaceships sweeping away entire hostile armada with one salvo of their cannons, develop futuristic technologies, explore vast solar system and discover forgotten history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your profile in RPG style </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have several paths to choose from, it's up to you which one you follow or whether you create a unique solution that suits your playing style. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strength -\u00a0</strong>win by choosing a path of strength and creating spaceships capable of single-handedly opposing countless enemy units.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wisdom -</strong> will allow you to develop futuristic technologies that will give you an advantage over your opponent and surprise his units. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership -</strong> create an armada that can defeat the most numerous opponents thanks to cooperation skills and good training.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/45db1bff5b56e659f1f65a889b30baac.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather\u00a0knowledge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas of knowledge and gain experience that will unlock new development opportunities, research, new equipment and help you understand enemy technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7b874bfff9acc62a828a3223627a9c3d.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct space stations orbiting planets and moons, produce spaceships, equipment and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research and gather resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources from asteroids and battles, invent new types of spaceships, weapons and upgrade them until they become even more deadly.<br><br><strong>Create equipment that will allow you to play the game in the way that is most enjoyable for you</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each weapon has up to 9 upgradeable parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each parameter can be upgraded up to a maximum of 20 level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >once you meet the requirements, you can unlock 3 stronger variants of a given weapon.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/ee90edddc5382ade2626a96d8170f1cb.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and conquer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your military capabilities across solar system to protect your most precious planet. Your goal is to get rid of enemy from the solar system.<br><br><strong>Play the way you like</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each spaceship has 9 upgradeable parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each parameter can be upgraded by 20 levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new and more powerful spaceships</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/3ef29940b03c8b4ce4c1f3e20500fb32.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=910 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007500?t=1762104872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/2a16aa0c6c877a65e85888dee94d240f1d83f4c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762104872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/a962f7ae3a17bc0ffa1f154421cd91a77179e70e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762104872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/a962f7ae3a17bc0ffa1f154421cd91a77179e70e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762104872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>TerrApocalipse is being developed</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the materials posted on Steam may be out of date. To keep up to date materials and follow almost daily update notifications please visit our social media.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TerrApocalipse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Defend planet Terra from threats, meet your unimaginably powerful enemy, build  spaceships sweeping away entire hostile armada with one salvo of their cannons, develop futuristic technologies, explore vast solar system and discover forgotten history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your profile in RPG style </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have several paths to choose from, it's up to you which one you follow or whether you create a unique solution that suits your playing style. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strength -\u00a0</strong>win by choosing a path of strength and creating spaceships capable of single-handedly opposing countless enemy units.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wisdom -</strong> will allow you to develop futuristic technologies that will give you an advantage over your opponent and surprise his units. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership -</strong> create an armada that can defeat the most numerous opponents thanks to cooperation skills and good training.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/45db1bff5b56e659f1f65a889b30baac.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather\u00a0knowledge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas of knowledge and gain experience that will unlock new development opportunities, research, new equipment and help you understand enemy technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7b874bfff9acc62a828a3223627a9c3d.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct space stations orbiting planets and moons, produce spaceships, equipment and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research and gather resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources from asteroids and battles, invent new types of spaceships, weapons and upgrade them until they become even more deadly.<br><br><strong>Create equipment that will allow you to play the game in the way that is most enjoyable for you</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each weapon has up to 9 upgradeable parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each parameter can be upgraded up to a maximum of 20 level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >once you meet the requirements, you can unlock 3 stronger variants of a given weapon.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/ee90edddc5382ade2626a96d8170f1cb.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and conquer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your military capabilities across solar system to protect your most precious planet. Your goal is to get rid of enemy from the solar system.<br><br><strong>Play the way you like</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each spaceship has 9 upgradeable parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each parameter can be upgraded by 20 levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock new and more powerful spaceships</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/3ef29940b03c8b4ce4c1f3e20500fb32.avif?t=1762104872\" width=1560 height=910 /></span></p>","developers":["StDesign"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/18d3dbca5136ad4d3f52d65bd339aa83dc273b61/header.jpg?t=1762104872","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-450M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 330M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</stro